alling for a more effective workout.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_FWiCMj":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Merach_S36L2_Heimtrainer_Fahrrad_Schwarz-3_6.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Compatible Apps","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Merach, Kinomap, Zwift, Apple Health, Google Fit.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}},"item_cmGzgG":{"type":"item","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Merach_S36L2_Heimtrainer_Fahrrad_Schwarz-3_4.jpg","column_size":"3","title":"Double Bottle Holder","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Stay hydrated anytime without interrupting your workout.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link","check-bg":"#000000","check-color":"#ffffff"}}},"block_order":["item_AUKXdT","item_HxLrkL","item_77zXwN","item_eYLWgW","item_FWiCMj","item_cmGzgG"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":false,"gap":"medium","text_alignment":"center","subheading":"","title":"","content":"","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"faq_AQMb9a":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"item_qgpXYC":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"1. How quiet is the Merach S36 exercise bike during use?","content":"<p>The Merach S36 operates with a noise level of under 25 dB, making it exceptionally quiet. This allows you to enjoy smooth and focused workouts at home without disturbing family members or neighbours.<\/p>"}},"item_E7Eizc":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"2. What user height and weight does the Merach S36 exercise bike support?","content":"<p>The Merach S36 is suitable for users between 142 cm and 193 cm in height and supports a maximum user weight of up to 150 kg, making it ideal for a wide range of home users.<\/p>"}},"item_EB6dft":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"3. Which fitness apps are compatible with the Merach S36?","content":"<p>The Merach S36 can connect to severa